// The +1/+1 counter ([CR#122.1a]): each one adds 1 to power and 1 to
// toughness in layer 7c ([CR#613.4c]). Confers the boost DIRECTLY (a
// continuous effect, the ability-free `Property` flavor) — not an ability that
// grants a boost. The conferral is what ONE counter confers; the model applies
// it once per counter held, so it reads no count. Inherently strip-immune: a creature whose abilities are all removed still
// gets the bonus.
CounterKind(
    name: "p1p1Counter",
    params: [],
    compound_stem: Measure,
    compound_onset: Consonant,
    spelling: "+1/+1",
    body: Counter(
        kind: Named(name: "p1p1Counter"),
        holder: Object,
        confers: [
            Property(spec: PtModification(subject: This, power: Up(amount: 1), toughness: Up(amount: 1))),
        ],
    ),
)
